    "description": "<h2 data-start=\"139\" data-end=\"214\"><strong data-start=\"142\" data-end=\"214\">Professional AC Servicing in Bangladesh – Stay Cool with Expert Care</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"216\" data-end=\"604\">At <strong data-start=\"219\" data-end=\"240\">Rango Electronics</strong>, we provide <strong data-start=\"253\" data-end=\"304\">complete AC servicing and maintenance solutions</strong> to ensure your air conditioner delivers maximum cooling performance, energy efficiency, and long-lasting reliability. With years of experience and skilled technicians, we specialize in <strong data-start=\"490\" data-end=\"540\">split AC, window AC, and inverter AC servicing</strong> for both residential and commercial spaces across Bangladesh.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"606\" data-end=\"651\"><strong data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"651\">Why Regular AC Servicing Is Important</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"652\" data-end=\"992\">Over time, dust and dirt accumulate inside your AC, reducing airflow and cooling efficiency. Without proper maintenance, this can lead to higher electricity bills, bad odors, and even compressor damage. Regular AC servicing not only improves air quality but also extends your air conditioner’s lifespan and helps you save on repair costs.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1028\"><strong data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1028\">Our AC Servicing Includes:</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1774\">\n<li data-start=\"1029\" data-end=\"1186\">\n<p data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1186\">???? <strong data-start=\"1034\" data-end=\"1076\">Deep Cleaning (Indoor &amp; Outdoor Unit):</strong> Thorough cleaning of filters, evaporator coil, condenser coil, and drainage system to restore peak cooling.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1187\" data-end=\"1307\">\n<p data-start=\"1189\" data-end=\"1307\">⚙️ <strong data-start=\"1192\" data-end=\"1218\">Gas Check &amp; Refilling:</strong> Complete refrigerant level inspection and top-up to ensure proper cooling performance.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1308\" data-end=\"1404\">\n<p data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1404\">???? <strong data-start=\"1313\" data-end=\"1339\">Filter &amp; Fan Cleaning:</strong> Removal of dust and bacteria buildup for fresh, clean airflow.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1405\" data-end=\"1552\">\n<p data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1552\">???? <strong data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1454\">Compressor &amp; Electrical Component Check:</strong> Inspection of compressor, capacitor, thermostat, and other key parts for early issue detection.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1553\" data-end=\"1663\">\n<p data-start=\"1555\" data-end=\"1663\">???? <strong data-start=\"1558\" data-end=\"1586\">Cooling Efficiency Test:</strong> Performance testing to make sure your AC is working at optimal efficiency.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1664\" data-end=\"1774\">\n<p data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1774\">???? <strong data-start=\"1669\" data-end=\"1695\">Home &amp; Office Service:</strong> We offer quick and professional on-site AC servicing anywhere in Bangladesh.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-start=\"1776\" data-end=\"1813\"><strong data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1813\">Why Choose Rango Electronics?</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"1814\" data-end=\"1963\">✅ Skilled &amp; Certified Technicians<br data-start=\"1847\" data-end=\"1850\" />✅ Fast and Reliable Service<br data-start=\"1877\" data-end=\"1880\" />✅ Affordable Pricing<br data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"1903\" />✅ Genuine Spare Parts<br data-start=\"1924\" data-end=\"1927\" />✅ Customer Satisfaction Guaranteed</p>\n<p data-start=\"1965\" data-end=\"2094\">We handle all major brands including <strong data-start=\"2002\" data-end=\"2081\">Gree, Haier, Samsung, LG, Walton, Midea, General, Sharp, Hitachi, Hisense</strong>, and more.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2096\" data-end=\"2118\"><strong data-start=\"2100\" data-end=\"2118\">Service Areas:</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"2119\" data-end=\"2249\">We provide <strong data-start=\"2130\" data-end=\"2172\">AC servicing, installation, and repair</strong> in <strong data-start=\"2176\" data-end=\"2246\">Dhaka, Chattogram, Sylhet, Khulna, Rajshahi, and across Bangladesh</strong>.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"2251\" data-end=\"2283\"><strong data-start=\"2255\" data-end=\"2283\">Book Your Service Today!</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"2284\" data-end=\"2472\">Beat the heat with our trusted AC servicing solutions. Whether it’s for your home, office, or commercial setup, our expert team is ready to help you enjoy cool, clean air all year round.</p>\n<p data-start=\"2474\" data-end=\"2648\">???? <strong data-start=\"2507\" data-end=\"2519\">Website:</strong> <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" target=\"_new\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2520\" data-end=\"2576\">www.rangoelectronics.com</a><br data-start=\"2576\" data-end=\"2579\" />???? <strong data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2648\">Rango Electronics – Your Trusted Cooling Partner in Bangladesh</strong></p>",
