    "description": "<div class=\"block-header\"><span class=\"block-header-text\">Description</span></div>\n<div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"block-content block-description\">\n<h2><b>Hisense BD189BLK 189 L Chest Refrigerator in Bangladesh</b></h2>\n<p>The <a href=\"https://rangoelectronics.com/product-category/refrigerator/chest-freezer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hisense</a> BD189BLK 189 L Chest <a href=\"https://rangoelectronics.com/product-category/refrigerator/chest-freezer/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Refrigerator</a> is a spacious and efficient cooling solution for homes and businesses in Bangladesh. Designed with a recessed handle and a sleek foaming door, this refrigerator provides a modern look while offering ample storage capacity. With a 189-liter net capacity, it’s perfect for storing frozen goods, and its ST climate class ensures it performs well in temperatures ranging from 18°C to 38°C. The manual defrost system, combined with its simple control system, makes this chest refrigerator easy to maintain and operate.</p>\n<h2><b>Technical Details</b></h2>\n<p>The Hisense BD189BLK Chest Refrigerator has a gross capacity of 189 liters and operates on a voltage/frequency of 220~240V / 50Hz. With a maximum noise level of 42 dB(A), it runs quietly, making it ideal for any space. It comes equipped with an inside condenser, and the unit’s PU/C-P foaming components provide excellent insulation. This refrigerator is certified by CB, ensuring safety and compliance with international standards. The interior features include an LED light on the door, a door lock for added security, and a basket for better organization. It has 2 fixed feet and 2 directional wheels for easy movement.</p>\n<h2><b>Availability and Usability</b></h2>\n<p>The Hisense BD189BLK 189 L Chest Refrigerator is offering a practical and affordable solution for households and businesses alike. Its spacious design makes it perfect for bulk storage of frozen foods, while the manual defrost and simple control system ensure ease of use. With its quiet operation and efficient cooling performance, this chest refrigerator is ideal for various climates in Bangladesh. Check the Hisense BD189BLK Price in BD for the best deal.</p>\n<h2><b>Highlights</b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>189-Liter Capacity With A Foaming Door Design</li>\n<li>ST Climate Class For Operation In 18°C To 38°C</li>\n<li>Manual Defrost System With Easy-To-Use Controls</li>\n<li>LED Light On The Door And A Lock For Added Security</li>\n<li>Includes 2 Fixed Feet And 2 Directional Wheels For Mobility</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
