    "description": "<div class=\"block-header\">\n<div class=\"o_g parameterList\">\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-3 o_xs_2-2 \">\n<h2 class=\"parameterListtitle\">General Specifications</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"o_u o_g o_df_2-3 o_xs_2-2 parameterListdetails\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Type:Chest Freezer</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Door Finish:Premium Glass</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Colour:Deep Ash</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Total Gross Capacity (L):142L</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Internal Light:No</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Sliding Glass:No</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Net Weight (kg):28.5</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Gross Weight (kg):32</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Handle:Recessed Handle</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Climate Class:T</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Compressor Type:Fix</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Refrigerant:R600a</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Dimension (WxDxH) (mm):630 x 568 x 865</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Voltage Range:160V ~ 275V</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Hinge:Balanced Hinge</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Lock &amp; Key:No</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Control Panel:Dual Function (REF &amp; FRZ)</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Power-on Light:Yes</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Basket:1</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Wheel:Yes</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"o_g parameterList\">\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-3 o_xs_2-2 \">\n<h2 class=\"parameterListtitle\">Warranty</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"o_u o_g o_df_2-3 o_xs_2-2 parameterListdetails\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Compressor:10 Years</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Parts and Service:2 Years</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"block-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"block-content block-description\">\n<h2><b>Haier HCF-175SG 142L Chest Freezer in Bangladesh</b></h2>\n<p>The Haier HCF-175SG 142L Chest Freezer is a reliable and efficient appliance designed to meet your freezing needs. With a generous capacity of 200 liters, it offers ample storage space for your frozen goods.This chest freezer operates on a frost system, which ensures that frost buildup is minimized, reducing the need for manual defrosting. The freezer is designed to function optimally in a T climate type, making it suitable for various ambient temperature conditions.The Haier HCF-175SG runs on a rated voltage of 220-240V and a frequency of 50Hz, ensuring compatibility with standard electrical systems. With a rated current of 1.2A, it consumes minimal electricity while providing optimal cooling performance.This chest freezer is designed to be energy-efficient, with an energy consumption rating of 0.99kW-h/24h. This means that it consumes less than 1 kilowatt-hour of electricity per day, helping you save on energy costs in the long run.The Haier HCF-175SG utilizes the refrigerant R134a, with a capacity of 140g. This refrigerant is known for its environmental friendliness and its ability to efficiently maintain low temperatures.Despite its spacious capacity, the Haier HCF-175SG remains relatively lightweight, weighing approximately 44kg. This makes it easier to transport and maneuver as needed.Overall, the Haier HCF-175SG 142L Chest Freezer offers a combination of practical features, energy efficiency, and reliable performance, making it an excellent choice for both residential and commercial settings.</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
