    "id": "rango-11090",
    "slug": "gree-gs-30xfv32-2-5-ton-fairy-split-type-inverter-air-conditioner",
    "title": "Gree GS-30XFV32 2.5 Ton Fairy Split Type Inverter Air Conditioner",
    "category": "air-conditioner",
    "subcategory": "2-5-ton-inverter-and-non-inverter-ac",
    "brand": "Gree",
    "model": "RN-11090",
    "price": 124990,
    "originalPrice": 142000,
    "discount": 12,
    "rating": 4.8,
    "ratingCount": 18,
    "inStock": true,
    "stockCount": 23,
    "badge": "Official",
    "thumbnail": "https://rangoelectronics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/18-1-1.jpg",
    "images": [
      "https://rangoelectronics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/18-1-1.jpg",
      "https://rangoelectronics.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/18-1-1.jpg"
    ],
    "shortDescription": "Gree GS-30XFV32 Fairy Split Type 2.5 Ton Inverter Air Conditioner The Gree GS-30XFV32 2.5 Ton Split Type Inverter Air Conditioner features a capacity of 12,000 BTU/Hr. It offers efficient cold plasma to make breathing cleaner. It comes with a fully closed air guide louver & top-m",
    "description": "<h2><b>Gree GS-30XFV32 Fairy Split Type 2.5 Ton Inverter Air Conditioner</b></h2>\n<p>The Gree GS-30XFV32 2.5 Ton Split Type Inverter Air Conditioner features a capacity of 12,000 BTU/Hr. It offers efficient cold plasma to make breathing cleaner. It comes with a fully closed air guide louver &amp; top-mounted filter. This AC features an auto-clean function that will prevent the growth of harmful micro-organisms by eliminating the moisture inside the indoor unit. Your indoor unit evaporates the moisture inside of the unit. Activate this function to provide you with more clean and healthier air. The Gree GS-30XFV32 has the &#8220;I Feel&#8221; feature that incorporates two temperature sensors, one on the unit and the other on the remote handset. In this mode, the indoor blower in an AC runs for a few minutes even after the air conditioner is switched off. This helps keep the indoor coil dry and prevents dust or mold accumulation. It can reduce energy loss and defrost time by only defrosting when needed instead of by a set timer. The sleep mode on an air conditioner is designed so as to give you comfort during your sleep by increasing the temperature every hour as you require less cooling while asleep as your body gets cold. It offers comfortable airflow and a wide air supply while having a quiet design. The AC is featured with Ai intelligent control. It has a WiFi remote control for long-distance control of the unit for on and off, temperature and fan speed, etc. with a mobile phone WiFi.</p>\n<h3><b>Here&#8217;s a concise list of features for the Gree GS-30XFV32 Fairy Split Type (2.5 Ton) Inverter Air Conditioner:</b></h3>\n<p><b>Split Type:</b> Allows for separate indoor and outdoor units for efficient cooling.</p>\n<p><b>Inverter Technology: </b>Ensures energy efficiency by adjusting compressor speed.</p>\n<p><b>Capacity:</b> Powerful 2.5 Ton cooling capacity with 30000 BTU.</p>\n<p><b>Energy Saving Rating: </b>High efficiency with a rating of 3.41.</p>\n<p><b>Rotary Type Compressor:</b> Provides reliable and efficient cooling performance.</p>\n<p><b>Refrigerant Type:</b> Uses eco-friendly R-32 refrigerant.</p>\n<p><b>Power Consumption:</b> Up to 60% electricity saving.</p>\n<p><b>Dimensions &amp; Weight:</b> Compact indoor and outdoor unit design for easy installation and maintenance.</p>\n<p><b>Color: </b>Stylish white color design.</p>\n<p><b>Cooling Technology:</b> Capable of providing cooling only.</p>\n<p><b>Air Flow Directional Control:</b> Allows for control over the direction of airflow.</p>\n<p><b>Comfortable Sleeping Mode:</b> Optimizes settings for a comfortable sleeping environment.</p>\n<p><b>Timer:</b> Schedule the AC&#8217;s operation as per your convenience.</p>\n<p><b>Turbo Button:</b> Quickly cools down the room for immediate comfort.</p>\n<p><b>LED Display &amp; Clock Display: </b>Provides easy-to-read information and time display.</p>\n<p><b>Self Diagnosis: </b>Automatically detects and diagnoses issues for easier troubleshooting.</p>\n<p><b>Washable Air Purify Filters: </b>Ensures clean air circulation and can be easily cleaned.</p>\n<p><b>Lock Feature:</b> Secures settings to prevent accidental changes.</p>\n<p><b>Auto Restart &amp; Auto Clean:</b> Automatically restarts after a power outage and self-cleans for convenience.</p>\n<p><b>Healthy Filters:</b> Incorporates filters for enhanced air quality and health benefits.</p>\n<p><b>Cold Plasma &amp; Golden Fin:</b> Utilizes technologies for better cooling and durability.</p>\n<p><b>Intelligent Defrosting:</b> Smart defrosting function for efficient performance.</p>\n<p><b>Low Voltage Start-up:</b> Can start up even in low voltage conditions.</p>\n<p><b>Automatic Operation:</b> Adjusts settings automatically based on ambient conditions.</p>\n<p><b>1W Standby:</b> Low standby power consumption for energy efficiency.</p>\n<p><b>R32A:</b> Utilizes R32A refrigerant for better environmental sustainability.</p>\n<p><b>Installation and delivery charges must be paid by the customer. Delivery and installation charges may vary due to location and building height.</b></p>",
