    "description": "<section id=\"description\" class=\"description bg-white m-tb-15\">\n<div class=\"section-head\">\n<h2>Description</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"full-description\">\n<h2>Xiaomi A Pro 43 Inch QLED 4K UHD Smart Android Google TV (Global Version)</h2>\n<p>The <strong>Xiaomi A Pro</strong> 43 Inch QLED 4K UHD Smart Android Google TV (Global Version) is designed to transform your home entertainment experience with its stunning visuals and smart features. This 43-inch 4K TV boasts a 4K UHD (3840 x 2160) resolution, delivering incredibly sharp and detailed images that bring every scene to life. The QLED TV technology enhances color accuracy and brightness, providing a vibrant and lifelike viewing experience that is second to none. With a 60Hz refresh rate and MEMC (Motion Estimation, Motion Compensation) technology, this Smart TV ensures smooth and fluid motion, perfect for watching sports, action movies, or playing video games. Equipped with Google TV, the Xiaomi A Pro offers a seamless and intuitive interface, bringing together movies, shows, and more from your favorite apps and subscriptions. The built-in Google Assistant allows you to control the Android TV, search for content, and manage smart home devices using just your voice. Chromecast is also built-in, enabling you to stream content directly from your mobile devices to the Television. The TV features two powerful 12W speakers with Dolby Audio, DTS-X, and DTS Virtual:X support, delivering immersive and high-fidelity sound. The sleek and modern design of the Xiaomi TV includes an ultra-narrow bezel and a premium metallic frame, making it a stylish addition to any room. Connectivity options are plentiful, with three HDMI ports (one with eARC), two USB 2.0 ports, Bluetooth 5.0, and Wi-Fi 6 support, ensuring you can easily connect all your devices. The TV also includes an Ethernet port, optical digital audio out, and a headphone jack for added convenience. With its energy-efficient design and comprehensive smart features, the Xiaomi A Pro 43 Inch QLED 4K UHD Smart Android Google TV is the perfect choice for anyone looking to upgrade their home entertainment setup. This Television combines performance, versatility, and style to meet all your viewing needs.</p>\n<h3>Stunning 4K QLED Display</h3>\n<p>The Xiaomi A Pro 43 Inch QLED 4K UHD Smart Android Google TV features a 4K QLED display that delivers breathtaking picture quality, making it a standout among 4K TVs. The 4K UHD resolution (3840 x 2160) ensures incredibly sharp and detailed images, bringing your favorite content to life with stunning clarity. The QLED TV technology enhances color accuracy and brightness, providing a wide color gamut and vibrant, lifelike visuals that make every scene pop. This advanced display technology also supports HDR (High Dynamic Range), which enhances the contrast and color range, making every scene look more realistic and immersive. Whether you&#8217;re watching movies, playing games, or streaming your favorite shows, the 4K QLED display of the Xiaomi TV ensures an unparalleled viewing experience with vivid colors and exceptional detail. The combination of QLED and 4K UHD technologies in this Smart TV offers a superior visual experience that is perfect for any home entertainment setup. With the Xiaomi A Pro, you can enjoy the best of both worlds: the latest in display technology and the convenience of a fully integrated Google TV platform. This Television is designed to provide a premium viewing experience, making it an excellent choice for anyone looking to enhance their home entertainment system.</p>\n<h3>Immersive Audio</h3>\n<p>Dolby Audio and DTS-X dual decoding technologies produce rich sound effects for a more immersive listening experience. Furthermore, the Xiaomi <strong>A Pro</strong> has DTS Virtual:X technology which simulates a movie experience by providing three-dimensional sound with an overhead dimension.</p>\n<h3>Entertainment With Google</h3>\n<p>Google TV curates movies, shows, and other material from your apps and subscriptions for tailored watching. Discover new things to watch with Mi A Pro TV, which provides suggestions based on what you&#8217;ve seen and what interests you from your subscriptions and available content.</p>\n<h2>Buy Xiaomi A Pro 43 Inch QLED 4K UHD Smart Android Google TV (Global Version) from Star Tech</h2>\n<p>In Bangladesh, you can get original <strong>Xiaomi A Pro 43 Inch QLED 4K UHD Smart Android Google TV (Global Version)</strong> From Star Tech. We have a large collection of latest <a href=\"https://rangoelectronics.com/product-category/smart-android-tv/\">Xiaomi TV</a> to purchase. Order Online Or Visit your Nearest Shop to get yours at lowest price. The Xiaomi A Pro 43 Inch QLED 4K UHD Smart Android Google TV (Global Version) comes with 01 Year Parts and 03 Year Panel Warranty.</p>\n<p>For warranty claims, please contact the Xiaomi distributor directly through the official customer service hotline at 01753919191.</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"latest-price\" class=\"latest-price bg-white m-tb-15\">\n<div class=\"section-head\"></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</section>",
