">APP Store / Browser:YES</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">HDMI Version:2.1</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Variable Refresh Rate (VRR):YES</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Auto Low Latency Mode (ALLM):YES</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Auto-Timer on / off:YES</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Bluetooth Remote:YES</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Digital Noise Reduction:YES</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"o_g parameterList\">\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-3 o_xs_2-2 \">\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-3 o_xs_2-2 \">\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-3 o_xs_2-2 \">\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-3 o_xs_2-2 \">\n<h2 class=\"parameterListtitle\">Structure</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"o_u o_g o_df_2-3 o_xs_2-2 parameterListdetails\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Gross Weight:16.4 KG</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Dimensions (WxHxD) just TV:1446*841*85</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Dimensions (WxHxD) TV with Stand:1446*330*90</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">No of Built-In Speakers:2</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Voltage Range:100-240V 50/60Hz</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"o_g parameterList\">\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-3 o_xs_2-2 \">\n<h2 class=\"parameterListtitle\">Warranty</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"o_u o_g o_df_2-3 o_xs_2-2 parameterListdetails\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Panel:4 Years</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Parts and Service:2 Years</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"o_g parameterList\">\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-3 o_xs_2-2 \">\n<h2 class=\"parameterListtitle\">Supplied Accessories</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"o_u o_g o_df_2-3 o_xs_2-2 parameterListdetails\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Remote Control:YES</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">User Manual:YES</div>\n</li>\n<li>\n<div class=\"o_u o_df_1-2 o_xs_2-2 leftname\">Wall Mount Kit:YES</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2>Description</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"full-description\">\n<h2>Haier H65P7UX 65 Inch Voice Control HQLED 4K Smart Google TV</h2>\n<p>The Haier H65P7UX 65-inch Smart TV delivers the world of entertainment right into your living room. With its incredible 4K HDR UHD resolution of 3840 x 2160 pixels, this television produces stunning visuals, bringing your favorite movies, TV shows, and video games to life with great clarity and beautiful colors. The Haier H65P7UX&#8217;s hands-free voice control capability. You can use your voice to navigate menus, search for content, and manage other TV functions for a hands-free viewing experience. This TV has a variety of input possibilities, including four HDMI connectors and two USB ports. These interfaces enable you to connect a variety of devices, including game consoles, streaming devices, soundbars, and more, allowing you to tailor your entertainment setup to your tastes. The Haier H65P7UX comes with 2GB of RAM and 32GB of internal storage, which ensures smooth and fast performance for your smart TV demands. This TV can handle everything, whether you&#8217;re streaming video, utilizing applications, or multitasking. Dolby Atmos is supported by the TV for an immersive audio experience, providing clear, rich sound that envelops you in a 3D audio experience. This is great for listening to high-quality movies, concerts, and gaming.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.startech.com.bd/image/catalog/television/haier/h55p7ux/h55p7ux-01.jpg\" alt=\"Haier H55P7UX 55 Inch Voice Control HQLED 4K Smart Google TV\" /></p>\n<h3>Stunning 4K UHD Display</h3>\n<p>The Haier H65P7UX HQLED Smart Google TV with Enjoy dazzling images on the 65-inch 4K UHD display with a resolution of 3840&#215;2160 pixels. This high-resolution screen provides crisp and vivid visuals, immersing you in a world of crystal-clear entertainment.</p>\n<h3>HDR10 and Dolby Vision Support</h3>\n<p>With HDR10 and Dolby Vision support, you can enjoy improved contrast and vibrant colors. Your favorite movies, programs, and games come to life with lifelike and colorful images.</p>\n<h3>Immersive Dolby Atmos Audio</h3>\n<p>The Haier H65P7UX 65&#8243; TV has Immerse yourself in cinematic sound with Dolby Atmos compatibility, which provides a three-dimensional audio experience with sounds coming from all directions. In addition, the TV has 15W*2 speakers for clear and strong sounds.</p>\n<h3>Customizable Audio Experience</h3>\n<p>The Haier H65P7UX 65&#8243; Smart TV allows you to customize your audio experience with User, Standard, Night, Sports, Movie, Music, News, and Auto options. Adjust the sound balance and mute the TV as needed to suit your preferences. The TV also has DBX-TV technology for increased audio quality.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.startech.com.bd/image/catalog/television/haier/h50p7ux/h50p7ux-06.jpg\" alt=\"Haier H50P7UX 50 Inch Voice Control HQLED 4K Smart Google TV\" /></p>\n<h3>Seamless Mobile Casting</h3>\n<p>The Haier H65P7UX 65&#8243; HQLED Smart TV with Chromecast offers you to easily cast content from your mobile devices to the TV screen, making it simple to share your favorite entertainment with family and friends.</p>\n<h3>Picture Modes for All Occasions</h3>\n<p>Choose between User, Standard, Vivid, Sport, Movie, Game, and Energy Saving image modes to match your content and viewing preferences. The TV produces bright and sharp pictures even in fast-paced action scenes thanks to digital noise reduction.</p>\n<h3>Wide Viewing Angle</h3>\n<p>The H65P7UX Television has a 178-degree horizontal and vertical viewing angle, guaranteeing constant image quality from various seating positions in your living room.</p>\n<h3>Versatile Connectivity</h3>\n<p>Connect your devices simply with four HDMI connections, including HDMI 2.1, for high-quality video and audio transmission. The TV also supports DVB-T+C+T2 H.265 digital TV and PAL/SECAM/NTSC analog TV, providing a variety of connecting choices to fit your demands.</p>\n<h3>Ample Storage and Memory</h3>\n<p>The Haier H65P7UX 65 Inch HQLED 4K Smart Google TV comes with 2GB of RAM and 32GB of internal storage, providing room for apps and media. This ample storage ensures you can install your favorite apps and store your content without running out of space.</p>\n<h2>Buy Haier H65P7UX 65 Inch Voice Control HQLED 4K Smart Google TV from the best Television Shop in BD</h2>\n<p>In Bangladesh, you can get the original Haier H65P7UX 65 Inch Voice Control HQLED 4K Smart Google TV From Star Tech. We have a large collection of the latest <a href=\"https://rangoelectronics.com/product-category/smart-android-tv/\" target=\"\">Haier TVs</a> to purchase.  The Haier H65P7UX 65 Inch HQLED 4K Smart Google TV comes with Official Warranty: 4 Years Panel and 2 Years Parts &amp; Service Warranty. (Haier Warranty card must be kept for warranty claims.) For warranty claims, please contact the Haier distributor directly through the official customer service hotline at 09666880099.</p>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"latest-price\" class=\"latest-price bg-white m-tb-15\">\n<div class=\"section-head\">\n<h2>What is the price of Haier H65P7UX 65 Inch HQLED 4K Smart Google TV in Bangladesh?</h2>\n</div>\n<p>The latest price of Haier H65P7UX 65 Inch HQLED 4K Smart Google TV in Bangladesh is 102,900৳. You can buy the Haier H65P7UX 65 Inch HQLED 4K Smart Google TV at best price from our website or visit our showrooms.</p>\n</section>",
